# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# Fire seen only through a carving: the pumpkin sprite has an OPAQUE near-black
# surround and a TRANSPARENT carving, so the fire boxed beneath it shows
# through the eyes and grin and nowhere else. The ramp keeps the fire DEEPER
# than the orange shell (dark red cavity, yellow-white licks) so the face reads,
# and its first stop is an ember, not black, so the carving never goes out.
# Designed at 32x32 (`U`): one pumpkin fills any panel, one bat roosts on it
# and a second flits across the top, behind it, on a keyframe track.
S - Jack-o'-Lantern
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 32 32 normal 100 none fill 1
N Fire
I @pat/perlin-fire
C sliderFlameHeightPct 6553600
R 100 0:2a0400 80:6a0c00 150:c02400 205:ff9a00 240:ffe08a 255:fff8e0
L sprite 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Pumpkin
I @spr/jack-o-lantern
L sprite 16 1 0 0 normal 100 none fill 3
N Bat 2
I @spr/bat
A 11
#   ms    x   y  opacity ease
M 0       48  4  =       linear
M 6000    -32 0  =       linear
M 8000    -32 0  =       step
L sprite 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Bat
I @spr/bat
